 images. Nikon EclipseE400, Osram HBO100W/2 mercury lamp, COHU CCD cameras, Pariss imaging spectrometer; motorized Prior OptiscanES9 stage. Same500ms exposure applied once in all readouts. Source operation supplies quantities; diagram geometry and colors are conceptual.","source_locator":"Main PDF p.3, printed 3718, Characterization; continued p.4"}]},"general_background":[{"id":"general-context","title":"Thermodynamics and kinetics","summary":"Thermodynamics describes which states are energetically favoured, while kinetics governs how quickly a system can move between them. A change can be favourable yet proceed slowly when an activation barrier or limited transport restricts the pathway.","label":"General background, not the authors' interpretation","reference":{"doi":"10.1021/cr400544s","url":"https://doi.org/10.1021/cr400544s","kind":"review","title":"Mechanisms of Nucleation and Growth of Nanoparticles in Solution","container":"Chemical Reviews","year":2014}}]}
